msgid "“The work is great and widely spread out, and we are separated on the wall, far from one another.”"
msgstr "“공사는 크고 넓게 퍼져 있어서, 우리는 성벽 위에 흩어져 서로 멀리 떨어져 있습니다.”"

msgid "Nehemiah 4:19"
msgstr "느헤미야 4:19"

msgid "Music: “The Desert of Dreams” by insydnis (CC-BY 3.0)  ·  “Desert theme” by yd (CC0)  ·  Sound: Kenney.nl (CC0)  ·  Scripture adapted from the World English Bible (public domain)"
msgstr "음악: “The Desert of Dreams” insydnis (CC-BY 3.0)  ·  “Desert theme” yd (CC0)  ·  효과음: Kenney.nl (CC0)  ·  성경 구절: World English Bible(퍼블릭 도메인)에서 번역"

